{"language":"cn","values":[["/names/cn","埃隆"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名擅长聚集敌人的游侠，擅长搭配拥有范围效果的友军。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","以剑客之名。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","By the title of the swordsman!"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","每一步的修行都不可或缺"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","No step of practice can be missed!"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","凛风、寒冰、融为一体吧！"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","May the wind and frost unite as one!"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","还有所不足啊……"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_i18n/en","I have yet to reach... my... full... potential..."],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","每一剑都是见证"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_i18n/en","Every sword is a witness."],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","有人在呼唤着我"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/cn","以锋刃明志，我会秉承剑之道。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/cn","这柄剑，希望它能斩断一切。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/cn","寒冰与凛风交织的剑刃所向披靡。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","对一个远离故土的游子来说，这是最好的礼物。"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","谢谢，我会珍惜这份礼物。"],["/skins/0/name_i18n/cn","凛风之刃"],["/skins/0/description_i18n/cn","寒霜与凛风交织的剑刃，寄托着丛林的希望。"],["/skins/1/name_i18n/cn","弥萨忒之剑"],["/skins/1/description_i18n/cn","“剑”诞生的意义，就是守卫丛林的子民。"],["/skins/1/acquisition_i18n/cn","完成剧情任务“翡绿的净化”特定环节获得。"],["/skins/1/quality_i18n/cn","精英"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","稍作休息吧"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","要是绿植多一些就好了"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","加了冰块的茶……不错"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","雪花与灯火……"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","隆冬节……该回月湖村了"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","装饰让人心生暖意"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","今晚，要去看焰火吗？"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","埃隆双剑中其中一把是在薄暮丛林中打造而成的，使用魔法剑的能力则是在游历时习得的。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","月湖村周围的一块名贵草药田里，有一小块比周围的矮，据达赫妮婆婆说，那是埃隆小时候不小心砍断的。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","埃隆曾带着奄奄一息的受伤的鸟兽来到流荧树前，神奇的是，它们的伤势真能在树前奇迹般好转。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","薄暮丛林与外界鲜少交流。埃隆刚开始游历时，曾试图用叶子作为货币付旅费。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","圣石镇的餐馆中，至今仍流传着老板娘见一个身无分文的绿裔青年过于俊美，头脑一热就为其免单的轶事。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","埃隆的双剑中，其中一把并非实体，而是魔法汇聚而成的造物，随时都能改变形状。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","埃隆从小不离身的剑其实并未开刃，在不懂剑术的人手中毫无威力，在埃隆的手中却所向披靡。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","埃隆会时刻保持自己的衣摆没有一丝褶皱，却不会挥手赶走栖身于手臂上的小鸟。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","埃隆游历时，连耀光王都的居民都惊叹于这位绿裔青年的礼数之周正，装扮之别致，还掀起了一股鹿角头饰的风潮。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","在薄暮丛林众人的眼里，埃隆几乎没有做不到的事——除了莱卡。她知道埃隆所有不擅长处理的日常事务。"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","……发生了这么多事，今后丛林会走向怎样的方向呢？"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415013.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","埃隆 & 雅顿"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","稍作休息吧"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415100.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","埃隆"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","加了冰块的茶……不错"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415101.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","埃隆"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","雪花与灯火……"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415409.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","埃隆"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","隆冬节……该回月湖村了"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415410.json"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/cn","埃隆"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/cn","装饰让人心生暖意"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415581.json"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/cn","埃隆"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/cn","今晚，要去看焰火吗？"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415582.json"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/cn","埃隆"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/cn","新生的树该怎么照顾呢。"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415671.json"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/cn","因度厄 & 埃隆"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/cn","说起来，我们三个真是难得聚在一起。"],["/interaction_records/8/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn2/herohub_story/10412110.json"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/cn","莱卡 & 埃隆 & 帕瑞莎"],["/interaction_records/9/preview_i18n/cn","卡夫拉，你的剑术十分了得。"],["/interaction_records/9/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn2/herohub_story/10412120.json"],["/interaction_records/9/title_i18n/cn","埃隆 & 卡夫拉 & 漫漫"],["/interaction_records/10/preview_i18n/cn","诸位，你们有没有觉得月影乡的人对外面有一些……奇怪的认知？"],["/interaction_records/10/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn2/herohub_story/10413080.json"],["/interaction_records/10/title_i18n/cn","埃隆 & 莱卡"],["/interaction_records/11/preview_i18n/cn","哎呀，麻烦事终于结束了。你们听，这一路东奔西走，连喝水的时间都没有，我嗓音都沙哑了……"],["/interaction_records/11/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn2/herohub_story/10413090.json"],["/interaction_records/11/title_i18n/cn","洛桑 & 埃隆"]]}